trait-aestheticsku-name = Aesthetic SKU
trait-aestheticsku-desc =
    Your body is built more fragile than others but is also a bit more aesthetic, resulting in a less sturdy build.
    You are a bit lighter (-10%), and your damage threshold both for being immobilized and shutting down is decreased. (-10hp to crit and -10hp to die)

trait-porcelaindoll-name = Porcelain Doll
trait-porcelaindoll-desc =
    Your body is built like a delicate piece of art.
    Instead of tough alloys, your surface is a soft skin simulacrum, or an ivory-like intricately decorated shell.
    You weigh a lot less (-30%), and your damage threshold both for being immobilized and shutting down is further decreased. (-15hp to crit and -30hp to die)

trait-heavymachinery-name = Heavy Machinery
trait-heavymachinery-desc =
    Your body is built like a tank... or a forklift.
    It might have been built for combat, or for a mining operation, all in all you're heavy, strong and durable.
    Thick internal struts, tougher alloys and reinforced joints let you endure a bit more abuse, as well as pry things slightly faster and hit things slightly harder.
    You are very heavy, trying to shove you is like trying to shove a smart fridge full of energy drinks, your body density is increased to 150% of normal.
